{"date":"2017-02-24","platform":"WEB","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/6b/29/281277_cNVqe.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/6b/29/281277_cNVqe.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/6b/29/281277_cNVqe.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/6b/29/281277_cNVqe.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/6b/29/281277_cNVqe.jpg"},"summary":"一只被称为“黑狐十大杰出青年”的黑狐前来向白月初挑战。这只黑狐名为颜如玉，本体是空陷山牛鬼，原是涂山二当家涂山容容的弟子，但只向她学习了技能而并未习得做人的道理，便匆匆下山体验人间的生活。在这个过程中，他与人类女捕快律笺文互生情愫。但颜如玉不懂人间的规矩犯下数条大罪，需要入狱60年，正直的律笺文便设计引颜如玉与她在苦情树下许愿来世再会，今生则再无相见的机会。在狱中，颜如玉被潜入的黑狐所骗，不仅失去了二人相爱的记忆，后更是被黑狐彻底附身。附身后的他受命挑战白月初，但所有招式均被白月初一一化解，之后白月初帮助颜如玉摆脱黑狐的控制，并与现世的律笺文再续前缘。","name":"狐妖小红娘 千颜篇","name_cn":"狐妖小红娘4 千颜篇","tags":[{"name":"国产","count":352,"total_count":159874},{"name":"恋爱","count":290,"total_count":557505},{"name":"狐妖小红娘","count":207,"total_count":2155},{"name":"奇幻","count":149,"total_count":464175},{"name":"漫画改","count":124,"total_count":853254},{"name":"漫改","count":120,"total_count":358930},{"name":"2017","count":112,"total_count":71097},{"name":"国漫","count":98,"total_count":15581},{"name":"绘梦","count":86,"total_count":2928},{"name":"搞笑","count":82,"total_count":632900},{"name":"TV","count":68,"total_count":1391412},{"name":"WEB","count":52,"total_count":71019},{"name":"2017年2月","count":48,"total_count":895},{"name":"玄幻","count":33,"total_count":8248},{"name":"中国","count":29,"total_count":31150},{"name":"腾讯","count":14,"total_count":1115},{"name":"治愈","count":11,"total_count":299702},{"name":"战斗","count":11,"total_count":465402},{"name":"绘梦动画","count":6,"total_count":539},{"name":"续作","count":3,"total_count":45558},{"name":"国创","count":3,"total_count":4165},{"name":"国产动画","count":3,"total_count":5615},{"name":"动画","count":3,"total_count":35477},{"name":"动漫","count":3,"total_count":3994},{"name":"催泪","count":2,"total_count":59892},{"name":"2010s","count":2,"total_count":5581},{"name":"6分","count":2,"total_count":2686},{"name":"爱情","count":2,"total_